msgid ""
"Setup guide for the internal `fa-deploy-ws` workspace used for FiveAges "
"robot deployment."
msgstr "`fa-deploy-ws` 是用于 FiveAges 机器人部署的内部工作空间，本指南介绍其配置方法。"

