msgid ""
"This workspace requires access to private repositories. Contact your team"
" lead for access if needed."
msgstr "该工作空间需要访问私有仓库。如需权限，请联系团队负责人。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md:11
