#: ../../source/1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md:14
#: 5366d98ac05c48f88f18dabe6f451502
msgid ""
"The `fa-deploy-ws` README is **not public**. After you have access, "
"follow **that repository’s README** and its init / quick-start scripts. "
"Flags, robot IDs, and on-robot YAML are documented only there."
msgstr ""
"`fa-deploy-ws` 的 README **不公开**。开通后以**该仓库 README** 及其 init / quick-start 脚本为准。参数、机器人 ID 和机上 YAML 只写在那里。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md:17
#: 546dfa7ce2c348328692fc1ef106bb01
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md:19
#: 4f820837aa7d4ec38b8e48f101a66c49
msgid ""
"`fa-deploy-ws` is the internal counterpart of [open-deploy-"
"ws](3-open_deploy_ws.md). Public users stay on `open-deploy-ws`."
msgstr ""
"`fa-deploy-ws` 是 [open-deploy-ws](3-open_deploy_ws.md) 的内部对应工作区。公开用户继续用 "
"`open-deploy-ws`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md:21
#: fec2cb4357024d22ac15889b2cd0fad4
msgid "What is verified on the **public** side and still applies as the pattern:"
msgstr "在**公开**侧已核实、仍可作为模式的内容："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md:23
#: 624ded5912534be5b83be941a6f50ed9
msgid ""
"Clone the workspace, then run **`./init_repo.sh`** (same script name as "
"[open-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/README.EN.md))."
msgstr ""
"克隆工作区，然后运行 **`./init_repo.sh`**（脚本名与 [open-deploy-ws](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/main/README.EN.md) 相同）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md:24
#: 4647535cf638477c8e55e238099b81e9
msgid "Do **not** `git submodule update --init --recursive`."
msgstr "**不要** `git submodule update --init --recursive`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md:25
#: 773212ba772e4b189b74fcec7ac32e3c
msgid ""
"After init, `colcon build`, then `source install/setup.bash` in the "
"launch terminal (standard ROS overlay)."
msgstr ""
"初始化后 `colcon build`，再在启动终端 `source install/setup.bash`。不要把手工 `~/.bashrc` "
"`source /opt/ros/...` 链当作文档路径。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md:27
#: a9c44045c1fd4413a6c9975d5c70a409
msgid ""
"Extra flags, robot IDs, and on-robot YAML live in the private README — "
"copy them from there."
msgstr "额外参数、机器人 ID 和机上 YAML 在私有 README 中 — 从那里复制。"

